(n)
"Scheduled Castes/Scheduled Tribes habitation" means any habitation where population of Scheduled Castes or
Scheduled Tribes is not less than forty percent of the total population of habitation;
(o)
"Notification" means notification published in the Gazette of Uttarakhand.
